QuaDRiGa
--------
The speed-check simulation (speedcheck_sim/) uses QuaDRiGa v2.8.1 (Fraunhofer Heinrich Hertz Institute,
https://github.com/fraunhoferhhi/QuaDRiGa, git 277866650eb115adb5b3e8ac252b0d1df073596d) under the QuaDRiGa Software
License (non-commercial scientific use). QuaDRiGa is not part of this repository and is not covered by the Apache
License. The file speedcheck_sim/tr37885/quadriga/patch/get_channels.diff modifies one file of QuaDRiGa,
@qd_builder/get_channels.m: an optional fifth input ray_out; when it is set, every output channel also carries the
per-ray coefficients (with the per-cluster factors applied) and the cluster index of each ray. With ray_out = 0 the
function is unchanged. The modification serves the per-ray scatterer-mobility term of 3GPP TR 37.885 V15.3.0,
clause 6.2.3. The patch is distributed under the QuaDRiGa Software License, whose text is reproduced in
speedcheck_sim/tr37885/quadriga/patch/QuaDRiGa_License.txt (modification notice: NOTICE.md in the same folder). The
script speedcheck_sim/tr37885/quadriga/patch/build_patched_tree.sh copies an unmodified QuaDRiGa checkout and applies
the patch to that copy (default location speedcheck_sim/quadriga_patched); the patch is not merged into this
repository.

Data
----
The synthetic telematics data set of So, Boucher and Valdez (2021) is not part of this repository; data/fetch_so2021.sh
downloads it from its authors' page under their terms (see data/README.md).
